"""Clothing and armor for the game humanoid.

A garment is a shell of the skin under it. It covers the joints it
names, stands off the layers below it by their thickness, and is cut
at clean hems. Plates ride one bone. Lames share two. Dyes, wear,
sockets, spring chains, cloth and engineering estimates complete the
system. See the wiki pages Garments, Outfits and armor, Cloth and
spring bones, and Attire estimates.
"""
